Error [E0080]: This named function body follows an arrow instead of braces.
  --> tests/ui/nested_option.jet:1:8
    |
  1 | fn f() -> Int ?? {
    |        ^^
 Why: A named function has one arrow, `->` or `-[Effects]>`, followed by its optional return type; the body always sits in braces: `fn name(...) -> Type { … }`.
 Fix: Replace `-> expr` with `{ expr }`; `jet fmt` applies this fix.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0080

Error [E0107]: Nothing named `Int` exists here
  --> tests/ui/nested_option.jet:1:11
    |
  1 | fn f() -> Int ?? {
    |           ^^^
 Why: A name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: Declare it first: `Int :: ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0107

Error [E0112]: `print` doesn't know how to show `Unit`
  --> tests/ui/nested_option.jet:5:18
    |
  5 | fn run() { print(f()) }
    |                  ^
 Why: Print shows values that have a display
 Fix: Print one of its parts instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
